%%label III. Presto
%%note A minor, 6/8. A headlong finale in two repeated halves, with unisons, a quiet episode for the flutes and a rush of scales to end.
X:1
T:C. P. E. Bach’s Missing Symphony
T:III. Presto
C:Claude (AI), in the manner of C. P. E. Bach
M:6/8
L:1/8
Q:"Presto" 3/8=132
%%score [fl ob bn] hn [v1 v2 va vc cb] hpd
% Original AI-composed homage. The score is written at sounding pitch.
V:fl clef=treble name="Fl. I, II"
V:ob clef=treble name="Ob. I, II"
V:bn clef=bass name="Bn."
V:hn clef=treble name="Hn. I, II"
V:v1 clef=treble name="Vl. I"
V:v2 clef=treble name="Vl. II"
V:va clef=alto name="Vla."
V:vc clef=bass name="Vc."
V:cb clef=bass name="Cb."
V:hpd clef=treble name="Hpd."
K:Am
V:fl
